  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2024 LB4067 Lebanon AC Joint Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The JR will be implemented by six DRA partners and 10 local partners. War Child is the lead of theresponse. WC will hold contractual relations with the Block Grant Manager and will put sub-awardagreements in place with the DRA partners. All DRA partners will enter into a partnership agreementwith their local partners for the implementation of the response.Based on the most urgent needs in Lebanon, as well as the consortium members&#x2019; areas of expertise,the joint response is focused on: FSL, MPC, Protection, Shelter, Health, WASH.</narrative>
  </description>
